sdhci

The register layout follows the offset and bit definitions in the Linux
kernel, drivers/mmc/host/sdhci.h, at commit ae31bcc9
(GPL-2.0-or-later). Only those facts were used; no source code was copied.
Command numbers and response types follow include/linux/mmc/mmc.h,
include/linux/mmc/sd.h and include/linux/mmc/core.h in the same tree.

The following work was consulted as a behavioural reference for the SD bus.
No source code was copied from it.

  enjoy-digital/litesdcard, commit 227d61bc
  BSD-2-Clause
  https://github.com/enjoy-digital/litesdcard

The behavioural card model in the testbench was written after the card
emulator in the same repository, litesdcard/emulator/verilog, which is
Copyright 2015 Google Inc. and 2017 Micah Elizabeth Scott under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. No source code was copied from it.

